    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλότροφ-ος</span></b>  (proparox.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond of
